  <item>
    <title>EP41【年中好内容—电影篇】｜20部电影轮番上阵，上半年打分最低就是哪吒</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a09142293471fed4f00001</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a09142293471fed4f00001</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Aug 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hello，朋友们~~~我们攒了半年的好电影迫不及待地想分享给大家。有正在上映的暑期档，也有很多可以线上观看的好电影。总之，全是认真观看后的真诚分享，希望大家能喜欢~</span><strong><span>（本期含大量剧透，介意的朋友们可以选择性收听）</span></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>如果你听后有想说的，欢迎给我们留言。</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎订阅我们。</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>最后，感谢每一位订阅、收听浮潜女孩的朋友❤</span></em></strong></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a></span><strong><span>《Kpop：猎魔女团》</span></strong><span>：喜欢Kpop的人一定会喜欢，BGM好听</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a></span><strong><span>《浪浪山小妖怪》&amp;《罗小黑战记2》&amp;《哪吒2》</span></strong><span>：浪浪山和罗小黑的优点就是哪吒的缺点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a></span><strong><span>《骗骗喜欢你》</span></strong><span>：博大家开心的反恋爱脑教育片；</span><strong><span>《误杀3》</span></strong><span>：别看！陈思诚是编剧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a></span><strong><span>《完美伴侣》</span></strong><span>：悬疑科幻片，反转不断，又是一部反恋爱脑教育片</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a></span><strong><span>《长安的荔枝》</span></strong><span>：大唐底层牛马遇到不靠谱领导，大时代下的心酸苦辣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">31:33</a></span><strong><span>《one day》&amp;《他其实没那么喜欢你》</span></strong><span>：浪漫爱叙事不灵了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2103">35:03</a></span><strong><span>《谁先爱上他》</span></strong><span>：同妻泪—东亚故事永动机；</span><strong><span>《诡（鬼）才之道》</span></strong><span>：做鬼还这么累的话真不如灰飞烟灭了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2466">41:06</a></span><strong><span>《去唱卡拉OK吧！》</span></strong><span>：能在大陆上映的B\L电影，你就品吧；</span><strong><span>《如何成为拉丁情人》</span></strong><span>：如何成为软饭男（无厘头喜剧）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2868">47:48</a></span><strong><span>《爱在黎明破晓前》&amp;《爱在日落黄昏时》&amp;《爱在午夜降临前》</span></strong><span>：经典爱情片，第三部太现实，果然回归生活的爱情啥也不是</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2931">48:51</a></span><strong><span>《首尔之春》</span></strong><span>：了解韩国人为什么对戒严令ptsd最佳作品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3149">52:29</a></span><strong><span>《蓦然回首》</span></strong><span>：关于青春，关于才华，关于友情，关于少女的羁绊</span></p><p><span>｜</span></p><p><span>本期责任编辑：MG</span></p><p><span>｜</span></p><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><p><span>Cool With You—NJZ</span></p><p><span>Golden—HUNTR/X（《Kpop：猎魔女团》BGM）</span></p><p><span>｜</span></p><p><span>【认识我们】</span></p><p><span>微博@酷酷的L-J@不丧良心的Lily @Hydroxylysine</span></p><p><span>你可以在小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/苹果Podcast/QQ音乐等平台收听浮潜女孩</span></p>]]></description>
