    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hello朋友们~我们两月一次的内娱外环观察家又来了！这两个月内娱好不热闹，但这个热闹好像并不是我们观众期待看到的。先是各种2代明星们上演社会新闻，又是注水影视剧和难看综艺轮番摧毁我们的大脑。内娱难道真如我们所言要完了？</span></p><span></span><p><span>ps：这期音质因为设备可能有点奇怪，给大家听感造成了不适感，抱歉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你听后有想说的，欢迎给我们留言。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎订阅我们。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>最后，感谢每一位订阅、收听浮潜女孩的朋友❤</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【传送门】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>一、内娱事件和人物</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a> 白玉兰新鲜出炉，宋佳、蒋欣实至名归</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> 赵丽颖疑似恋情曝光，怒怼渣浪算你妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> 黄杨耳环事件，令人恼火的社会新闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1181">19:41</a> 朱媛媛去世，R.I.P.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> 小沈阳女儿Nina韩国出道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">29:53</a> 朱丹“鸡腿”言论，到底该不该批判她？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2461">41:01</a> 那尔那茜事件</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>二、内娱影视综</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2651">44:11</a> 《长安的荔枝》——注的不是水，注的是大海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3244">54:04</a> 《歌手》开播，令人绝望的华语乐坛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3590">59:50</a> 《酱园弄》，令人绝望的内娱啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期责任编辑：MG</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bubble Gum-NewJeans</span></p><span></span><p><span>G大调协奏曲-维瓦尔第</span></p><span></span><p><span>Is This Love-XG</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜</