    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽~各位小朋友、大朋友们，六一儿童快乐！今天我们来聊聊迪士尼的公主宇宙，相信每位迪士尼在逃公主心中都住着一两个你曾经</span><strong><span>最最最最最</span></strong><span>想成为的公主角色，她们是勇敢、无畏、坚强、智慧、善良的代名词，从1937年《白雪公主》的诞生到2025年《海洋奇缘2》，迪士尼一边盛产经典公主角色，一边如火如荼推进真人版翻拍大业，那么期间经历了怎样的变迁？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期你会听到我们串讲：白雪公主、睡美人、灰姑娘、贝尔、茉莉公主、爱丽儿、花木兰、宝嘉康蒂、长发公主、梅莉达、艾莎&amp;安娜、莫阿娜这些</span><strong><span>迪士尼在编公主</span></strong><span>，也会听到我们吐槽近年迪士尼真人版的过分zzzz，还会听到主播情不能自已的随地大小唱，总之就是一期非常乐活的节目，希望各位小朋友、大朋友能开心鸭！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你听后有想说的，欢迎给我们留言。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎订阅我们。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>最后，感谢每一位订阅、收听浮潜女孩的朋友❤</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期责编：狗老师</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>【传送门】</span></p><span></span><p><span>详见答案页。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lily James - A Dream Is a Wish Your Heart Makes</span></p><span></span><p><span>Disney - Beauty and the Beast</span></p><span></span><p><span>倒影-叶蓓</span></p><span></span><p><span>成龙-男子汉</span></p><span></span><p><span>Naomi Scott - Speechless (Full)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lea Salonga &amp; Brad Kane - A Whole New World</span></p><span></span><p><span>Idina Menzel - Let It Go (From _Frozen__Soundtrack Version)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Kristen Bell &amp; Agatha Lee Monn &amp; Katie Lopez - Do You Want to Build a Snowman_ (From _Frozen__Soundtrack Version)</span></p><span></span><p><span>后妈茶话会-tough love</span></p><span></span><p><span>4_TOWN (From Disney and Pixar’s Turning Red) &amp; Jordan Fisher &amp; FINNEAS &amp; Josh Levi &amp; Topher Ngo &amp; Grayson Villanueva - Nobody Like U (From _Turning Red__Soundtrack Version)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Idina Menzel &amp; Evan Rachel Wood - Show Yourself (From _Frozen 2__Soundtrack Version)</span></p><span></span><p><span>【认识我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@酷酷的L-J@不丧良心的Lily @Hydroxylysine</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在小宇