    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hello，朋友们~~~本期是一期内娱外环观察家。我们三个聊了3月和4月的十个内娱事件。但讲真，这两个月内娱着实有点无聊，电视电影没看点，综艺无聊，就连乐子也无“乐”可言，三位主播纷纷大喊：难道我们内娱真的要完吗？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你听后有想说的，欢迎给我们留言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎订阅我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，感谢每一位订阅、收听浮潜女孩的朋友❤</span></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>【进度条】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 方大同去世，R.I.P.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a> 王大陆——狂躁症男明星代表</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">13:01</a> 赵一博 ：我和雪梨在一起是事实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 百度开盒，饭圈狂热潮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 金子涵宣布退圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 芒果综艺怎么也不好看了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2209">36:49</a> 黄子韬生产卫生巾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2477">41:17</a> 宋祖儿复出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2847">47:27</a> 鹿晗&amp;关晓彤，顶流的恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2965">49:25</a> 石凯，订婚？出轨？刘姐直呼“我看男人眼光太差了！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期责任编辑：MG</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cool With You-NewJeans</span></p><span></span><p><span>三人游-方大同</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱爱爱-方大同</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别的人-方大同</span></p><span></span><p><span>饮酒歌-威尔第</span></p><span></span><p><span>苏州河-薛凯琪</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【认识我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@酷酷的L-J@不丧良心的Lily @Hydroxylysine</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/苹果Podcast/QQ音乐等平台收听浮潜女孩</span></p>]]></description>
