    <pubDate>Sun, 04 May 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hello，亲爱的朋友们！我们最爱的专题—野鸡内娱研究又来了~今天是爱吃瓜的内娱乐子人但三缺一版（狗老师有现实的瓜要处理）。我和刘姐盘点了内娱6对恨海情天CP，只能说很爱这种阴湿的爱恨纠葛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目纯属娱乐，大家就当听个乐子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你听后有想说的，欢迎给我们留言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎订阅我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，感谢每一位订阅、收听浮潜女孩的朋友❤</span></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>【进度条】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 恨海情天名词解释</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.女组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> 袁立&amp;李红，袁立文学与女同性恨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 卡黄CP，让CP粉炸成烟花的爱豆怎么样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a> 吴宣仪&amp;孟美岐，一路纠缠的南韩归国女idol</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2005">33:25</a> 杨幂&amp;刘诗诗&amp;唐嫣，顶流85花的爱恨情仇</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.男组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a> 井柏然&amp;付辛博，bobo他俩以前这么好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2633">43:53</a> 汪东城&amp;炎亚纶</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.最爱哪对？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a> 如果我是同人女，我肯定写袁立李红</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期责任编辑：明鸽</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>复刻回忆-Pianoboy高至豪</span></p><span></span><p><span>Good-Bye Baby-Y.H.Girls(原唱：missA)</span></p><span></span><p><span>光荣-bobo（井柏然 付辛博）</span></p><span></span><p><span>with the IE -JENNIE</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【认识我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@酷酷的L-J@不丧良心的Lily @Hydroxylysine</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/苹果Podcast/QQ音乐等平台收听浮潜女孩</span></p>]]></description>
