    <title>EP33 禁忌之恋盘点2.0｜谁把我刚熬好的中药换成冰美式了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fc5370623bc78c396e7502</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fc5370623bc78c396e7502</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 00:43:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽，大家好，这期我们又来聊聊肤浅的东西啦～本期节目是上期【背德影视剧盘点】的番外篇——那些端着喝中药都要坚持嗑下去的同性影视书作品。恰逢奥斯卡颁奖礼刚过去没多久，让我们想起了一些著名的少数群体电影，比如说：《达拉斯买家俱乐部》《月光男孩》《以你的名字呼唤我》《燃烧女子的肖像》《卡罗尔》等著名影片，以及《绿皮书》也涉及到过往同性群体的人权问题；包括在去年，007“下海”拍摄新片2024年《酷儿》，“性感神父”安德鲁.斯科特（代表作 神探夏洛克、伦敦生活）和保罗.麦斯卡（代表作 正常人、晒后假日）共演了（2023）《都是陌生人》，还有，范爷复出拍摄《绿夜》等等等等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们觉得，此类题材的作品正在百花齐放，所以，我们也得积极响应啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以这一期，让我们再次放下心中的成见，端起手中这杯苦涩又刺激的冰美式，cheers～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期责任编辑：狗老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【传送门】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> 为什么“男男”“女女”CP在影视剧中受欢迎？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 主竞赛单元1—“兄弟情”（大型同妻泪现场）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 电影《请以你的名字呼唤我》：两个小帅在意大利乡村的summer camp式回忆</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a>电影《断背山》：美国农村跑马汉子的禁忌之恋</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a>电影《喜宴》：“东亚人性压抑五千年的结果”</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a>韩剧《秘密关系》：三攻一受的爱恨纠葛，没有女主的乙女游戏</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a>韩剧《当我的指尖触碰到你的温度时》 ：令人心动的橘子🍊吻</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a>泰剧《爱情猎杀》：以为在看某款钙片</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a>泰剧《以你之爱诠释我的心》：一边学汉语，一边拉扯，国人看着就是带劲</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a>国产《上瘾》：开启国内ＤＭ元年</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2049">34:09</a>小帅&amp;小帅为什么好嗑？无权力压迫的势均力敌的爱情，那才是真爱</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2307">38:27</a>来自腐女的真情流露：嗑真人cp有风险，营业的男同胞们，慢点塌，或者等我下头了再塌</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">41:32</a> 主竞赛单元2—“姐妹情”</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 电影《小姐》：金敏喜和金泰梨不演百合简直是宇宙人民的损失</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2803">46:43</a>电影《卡罗尔》：小白兔和大魔王双女主成长线，失而复得的爱情才珍贵</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> 电影《雪花秘扇》：都不说她们相互喜欢是吧？我也不说</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3048">50:48</a> 电影《阿黛尔的生活》：喜欢一个人，当然是想和ta睡觉</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3255">54:15</a>电影《蓝色大门》：虽然，我闭着眼睛也看不见自己，但是，我却可以看见你</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3432">57:12</a> 为什么”小美&amp;小美”的作品很难出圈？</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3710">61:50</a>意难平同性CP</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3715">61:55</a>不在乎天长地久，只要曾经拥有</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3810">63:30</a>小说《将进酒》唐酒卿：乔天涯和姚温玉</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3916">65:16</a>电影《春光乍泄》：黎耀辉和何宝荣</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3993">66:33</a>小说《洛希极限》几杯：李决和应允承</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>如果你听后有想说的，欢迎给我们留言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎订阅我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢每一位订阅、收听浮潜女孩的朋友们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝各位姐妹挣钱多多！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sufjan Stevens - Mystery of Love</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Psychedelic Furs - Love My Way</span></p><span></span><p><span>Teddy Thompson - I Don't Want To Say Goodbye</span></p><span></span><p><span>PP Krit - 如何 (From แปลรักฉันด้วยใจเธอ)</span></p><span></span><p><span>侯志坚 - 蓝色意识 序曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>【认识我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@酷酷的L-J@不丧良心的Lily@Hydroxylysine</span></p>]]></description>
