    <title>EP29【妇女节特辑】|从《还有明天》到三八妇女节，来聊点新叙事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ca88890766616acd3c2835</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ca88890766616acd3c2835</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Mar 2025 06:07:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽各位朋友们大家好！先祝各位姐妹们</span><strong><span> 三八国际劳动妇女节</span></strong><span>快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>早早得知</span><strong><span>《还有明天》</span></strong><span>要在妇女节上映，因此本期是我们蓄谋已久的</span><em><strong><span>三八妇女节特别节目</span></strong></em><span>，剪辑的时候真心觉得，这次我们节目真是登上新高度呢~本期你会听到：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>三八妇女节的前生今世；</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>《还有明天》《初步举证》为首的各类女性主义电影多元化出现，是好事还是坏事？</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>如今我们怎么看十年前流行的“女生节”；</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>问话三款AI，当代女性如何过好这一生；</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>主播倾情推荐的女性主义文艺作品</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>PS：本期包含剧透，所以大家快去看电影！（不介意的话可以先听节目哒~）</span></p><span></span><p><span>责任编辑：狗老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【传送门】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> 三八妇女节起源于国际工人运动，国内妇女解放思潮起源于维新变法时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">05:46</a> 三八妇女节的污名化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 从《还有明天》聊到现实，我们的出口在哪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1303">21:43</a> 《还有明天》vs《出走的决心》，母女也许可以是同盟关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a> 18岁结婚？薛定谔的“成熟”;蒋胜男；妇女的土地权益</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1607">26:47</a> 婚姻关系里似乎无法完全脱离家暴的伤害？以暴制暴貌似也是不错的选择~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1928">32:08</a>跟父姓or跟母姓？ 后工业时代还在纠结这个？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> 女性主义电影百花齐放：《某种物质》《可怜的东西》《芭比》《初步举证》《诡才之道》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2747">45:47</a> 对曾经给我们留下过阴影的 sexually harass ，大声说“NO！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3217">53:37</a> “女生节”“女神节”“女王日”——妇女节的畸形变体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3538">58:58</a> 女性榜样时刻：邵艺辉、金斯伯格、张伟丽、插排姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3693">01:01:33</a> chat gpt </span><em><span>vs</span></em><span> 豆包 </span><em><span>vs </span></em><span>deepseek，AI提供的女性生存指南：“当代女性如何过好这一生？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4165">01:09:25</a> 明鸽安利：网文《她对此感到厌烦》——贴合时代，对自己、对女性会有全新认识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4251">01:10:51</a> &nbsp;狗老师安利：日剧《西瓜》——四位女主人公共同的治愈系故事，防年龄焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4390">01:13:10</a> 刘姐安利：电影《妇女参政论者》——我的女儿应该面对更好的世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4554">01:15:54</a> 播客邻居们，主播有句妇女节祝福想对你说</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Daniele Silvestri - A bocca chiusa</span></p><span></span><p><span>Billie Eilish - What Was I Made For</span></p><span></span><p><span>Chappell Roan - Pink Pony Club</span></p><span></span><p><span>Big Gigantic,Angela McCluskey - The Little Things</span></p><span></span><p><span>【认识我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@酷酷的L-J@不丧良心的Lily @Hydroxylysine</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/苹果Podcast/QQ音乐等平台收听浮潜女孩</span></p>]]></description>
